Hey all! I'm working on putting together an extra option in APRS settings to allow for better APRS VOX through one of the classic Baofeng cables. <br>Anyway, while I can mostly work out the actual code part, I figured I should first ask about how to merge things upstream? Is there any kind of procedure, or more of just the code-over-the-wall technique?<br>Anyway, fantastic software! Thanks for putting in the legwork and keeping it all together.<br>(also, please do consider a git repo; i understand you've had problems with support requests for main branch builds, but i feel there are ways around that and the benefits outweight the problems.)<br>-Parker KJ5DFL<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=6136">KJ5DFL</a> — Sun Jun 16, 2024 10:20 pm</p><hr />
